# TypeScript conventions

- ESM imports with `.js` extension (`import { x } from './foo.js'`).
- Validate MCP tool inputs with Zod in `src/tools/schemas.ts`.
- Format Truss API errors via `formatTrussError()` — do not leak keys in messages.
- Env loading: `loadAllEnv()` at CLI startup; `loadConfig()` for MCP server.
- CLI-only code lives under `src/ask/`; MCP server logic in `src/server.ts` + `src/tools/`.
- Use `maskSecret()` in doctor/env diagnostics — never print full API keys.
